  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal is considered inappropriate development within the Green Belt as defined within the National Planning Policy Framework Chapter 13 (Green Belt), adopted Local Plan Policy GB1 and adopted London Plan Policy G2. The proposal also fails to maintain the openness of the Green Belt. The proposal therefore fails to comply with the National Planning Policy Framework Chapter 13 (Green Belt), the adopted Local Plan Policies GB1 (Green Belt), CC1 (Context and Character) and CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and adopted London Plan Policy G2 (London's Green Belt). ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal, due to its scale, positioning and cramped plot would result in an incongruous and uncharacteristic addition to the street scene, causing harm to the local character, in addition to its location within the Green Belt resulting in a loss of openness. The proposal therefore fails to comply with the National Planning Policy Framework Chapter 13 (Green Belt), the adopted Local Plan Policies GB1 (Green Belt), CC1 (Context and Character) and CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and adopted London Plan Policy G2."
  ],
